_ue_connectable":{"text":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["一位年轻女子侧身而立，乌黑柔顺的长发如瀑布般垂落于肩头，几缕发丝轻拂在脸颊旁，发间点缀着细小的发饰，增添了几分古典韵味，她身穿一袭深灰色的传统汉服，衣料质感细腻，带有微微的光泽感，领口和袖口处有精致的暗纹刺绣，衣物贴合身形，勾勒出纤细的轮廓，她右手轻握一把古朴的油纸伞，伞柄为天然竹制，表面纹理清晰可见，伞面呈灰白色，边缘略显磨损，透露出岁月痕迹，伞顶装饰有黑色编织网状结构，形成独特的视觉焦点，她的姿态优雅从容，头部微微侧转，目光望向远方，眼神清澈而深邃，带着一丝淡淡的忧郁与沉思，嘴唇微启，仿佛正欲低语或沉浸在某种思绪中，整体画面以人物为主体，前景突出人物的面部轮廓、手部细节和伞柄的质感，中景呈现她半身的服饰和身体姿态，背景则是一片朦胧的自然景观，模糊的绿色植被和石墙构成柔和的虚化效果，营造出深远的空间感，构图采用经典的三分法，人物位于画面左侧，留出右侧大片空白，引导视线延伸至远处，同时利用伞柄的垂直线条与人物的斜向轮廓形成对比，增强画面的稳定性和视觉张力，光线柔和且均匀，来自左上方的漫射光使人物面部呈现出自然的明暗过渡，阴影细腻不突兀，高光集中在额角、鼻梁和手背，凸显皮肤的光滑质感，整体色调偏冷，以灰绿、深灰和墨色为主，营造出静谧、清冷且略带诗意的氛围，光影层次丰富但不过度强烈，呈现出一种电影级的胶片质感，仿佛是用专业相机在阴天室外拍摄，镜头带有轻微的颗粒感和色彩偏移，模拟真实摄影的质感，画面整体具有强烈的东方美学意蕴，融合了传统服饰、自然元素与现代审美，既像一幅工笔画，又似一张纪实摄影作品，充满故事感与情感张力，适合用于表达孤独、思念、怀旧或宁静致远的主题，画面中没有多余的装饰物或干扰元素，所有细节都服务于人物的情绪表达和环境氛围的营造，整体呈现出一种含蓄内敛、耐人寻味的艺术美感"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"一位年轻女子侧身而立，乌黑柔顺的长发如瀑布般垂落于肩头，几缕发丝轻拂在脸颊旁，发间点缀着细小的发饰，增添了几分古典韵味，她身穿一袭深灰色的传统汉服，衣料质感细腻，带有微微的光泽感，领口和袖口处有精致的暗纹刺绣，衣物贴合身形，勾勒出纤细的轮廓，她右手轻握一把古朴的油纸伞，伞柄为天然竹制，表面纹理清晰可见，伞面呈灰白色，边缘略显磨损，透露出岁月痕迹，伞顶装饰有黑色编织网状结构，形成独特的视觉焦点，她的姿态优雅从容，头部微微侧转，目光望向远方，眼神清澈而深邃，带着一丝淡淡的忧郁与沉思，嘴唇微启，仿佛正欲低语或沉浸在某种思绪中，整体画面以人物为主体，前景突出人物的面部轮廓、手部细节和伞柄的质感，中景呈现她半身的服饰和身体姿态，背景则是一片朦胧的自然景观，模糊的绿色植被和石墙构成柔和的虚化效果，营造出深远的空间感，构图采用经典的三分法，人物位于画面左侧，留出右侧大片空白，引导视线延伸至远处，同时利用伞柄的垂直线条与人物的斜向轮廓形成对比，增强画面的稳定性和视觉张力，光线柔和且均匀，来自左上方的漫射光使人物面部呈现出自然的明暗过渡，阴影细腻不突兀，高光集中在额角、鼻梁和手背，凸显皮肤的光滑质感，整体色调偏冷，以灰绿、深灰和墨色为主，营造出静谧、清冷且略带诗意的氛围，光影层次丰富但不过度强烈，呈现出一种电影级的胶片质感，仿佛是用专业相机在阴天室外拍摄，镜头带有轻微的颗粒感和色彩偏移，模拟真实摄影的质感，画面整体具有强烈的东方美学意蕴，融合了传统服饰、自然元素与现代审美，既像一幅工笔画，又似一张纪实摄影作品，充满故事感与情感张力，适合用于表达孤独、思念、怀旧或宁静致远的主题，画面中没有多余的装饰物或干扰元素，所有细节都服务于人物的情绪表达和环境氛围的营造，整体呈现出一种含蓄内敛、耐人寻味的艺术美感"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":998,"type":"KSampler","pos":[3690,3150],"size":[260,700],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":4693},{"localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":4684},{"localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":4685},{"localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":4686},{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":4687},{"localized_name":"步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"采样器名称","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"降噪","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[4679]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.41.0","Node name for S&R":"KSampler","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"seed":true,"steps":true,"cfg":true,"sampler_name":true,"scheduler":true,"denoise":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[666,"randomize",30,2.5,"er_sde","simple",1],"widgets_values_named":{"seed":666,"control_after_generate":"randomize","steps":30,"cfg":2.5,"sampler_name":"er_sde","scheduler":"simple","denoise":1}},{"id":999,"type":"easy cleanGpuUsed","pos":[3990,3360],"size":[180,30],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"输入任何","localized_name":"输入任何","name":"anything","type":"*","link":4688}],"outputs":[{"label":"输出","localized_name":"输出","name":"output","type":"*","links":[4738]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-easy-use","ver":"b0b47ca1372117fce575d9e744655344ebff6bef","Node name for S&R":"easy cleanGpuUsed","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}},"aux_id":"yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use"},"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":1000,"type":"ShowText|pysssss","pos":[4680,2520],"size":[370,370],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","link":4689}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","shape":6,"type":"STRING","links":null}],"title":"展示文本","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-custom-scripts","ver":"609f3afaa74b2f88ef9ce8d939626065e3247469","Node name for S&R":"ShowText|pysssss","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["Here is a detailed visual description and a set of prompts based on your request, optimized for generating the \"continuous ultra-close low-angle side-view\" effect.\n\n### Visual Scene Description\nThe camera is mounted or held extremely close to the girl's chest, creating a **macro, immersive perspective** where the texture of her skin and fabric fills the frame. The angle is **low**, looking slightly up at the collarbone and chin, emphasizing the side profile. As she walks steadily forward through the night, the background blurs into a **drifting, shifting stream of streetlights and shadows**, indicating forward motion.\n\nOne hand grips the phone steady against her ribcage, while the other hand rhythmically reaches across her body to **pull the front of her upper garment open**. This action reveals the layers beneath (vest, shirt, or bare chest) in a continuous, fluid motion. The lighting is a mix of cool moonlight and warm street reflections, highlighting the sheen of sweat or fabric movement.\n\n***\n\n### Image Generation Prompts\n\nYou can use the following prompts in tools like Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, or DALL-E 3.\n\n#### Option 1: Photorealistic & Cinematic (Best for Midjourney v6)\n> **Prompt:** continuous ultra-close low-angle side-view handheld selfie, locked tightly on the chest, a girl walking steadily forward at night, one hand holding the phone pressed against the chest, the other hand continuously pulling the front of the upper garment open revealing inner layers, night outdoor background drifting and shifting behind, ultra-close macro shot, depth of field, bokeh streetlights, fabric texture, skin texture, cinematic lighting, cool and warm light mix, steady motion, 8k, photorealistic, high detail --ar 9:16 --style raw --q 2 --v 6.0\n\n#### Option 2: Focus on Motion Blur & Fluidity (Best for Stable Diffusion XL)\n> **Prompt:** ultra-close side view selfie, chest level, girl walking forward at night, continuous motion, one hand holding phone, other hand pulling garment open, chest open, drifting background, shifting night background, motion blur, ultra-close, macro lens, f/1.2, handheld camera shake, fluid movement, continuous pull action, night outdoor, street lights streaking, 8k, unreal engine 5 render, ray tracing, volumetric light --ar 2:3 --no static, wide angle\n\n#### Option 3: Artistic & Atmospheric\n> **Prompt:** a girl walking at night, ultra-close low angle side selfie locked on chest, holding phone, pulling front of upper garment open continuously, background drifting and shifting, dreamy night atmosphere, continuous ultra-close shot, fabric unfolding, skin and fabric interlocking, light refraction, cinematic side profile, handheld perspective, steady walk, moody, ethereal, 8k --ar 16:9 --v 6.0\n\n### Key Visual Elements Breakdown\n*   **Perspective:** Ultra-close (macro) and low-angle to capture the chest and neck details.\n*   **Action:** \"Locked tightly\" implies the phone is the camera; the \"other hand\" is in constant motion pulling the clothes apart.\n*   **Background:** \"Drifting and shifting\" suggests a combination of motion blur and light streaks to convey forward movement.\n*   **Lighting:** Nighttime contrast between the dark interior of the garment and the light sources reflecting off the skin and fabric."],"widgets_values_named":{"text_0":"Here is a detailed visual description and a set of prompts based on your request, optimized for generating the \"continuous ultra-close low-angle side-view\" effect.\n\n### Visual Scene Description\nThe camera is mounted or held extremely close to the girl's chest, creating a **macro, immersive perspective** where the texture of her skin and fabric fills the frame. The angle is **low**, looking slightly up at the collarbone and chin, emphasizing the side profile. As she walks steadily forward through the night, the background blurs into a **drifting, shifting stream of streetlights and shadows**, indicating forward motion.\n\nOne hand grips the phone steady against her ribcage, while the other hand rhythmically reaches across her body to **pull the front of her upper garment open**. This action reveals the layers beneath (vest, shirt, or bare chest) in a continuous, fluid motion. The lighting is a mix of cool moonlight and warm street reflections, highlighting the sheen of sweat or fabric movement.\n\n***\n\n### Image Generation Prompts\n\nYou can use the following prompts in tools like Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, or DALL-E 3.\n\n#### Option 1: Photorealistic & Cinematic (Best for Midjourney v6)\n> **Prompt:** continuous ultra-close low-angle side-view handheld selfie, locked tightly on the chest, a girl walking steadily forward at night, one hand holding the phone pressed against the chest, the other hand continuously pulling the front of the upper garment open revealing inner layers, night outdoor background drifting and shifting behind, ultra-close macro shot, depth of field, bokeh streetlights, fabric texture, skin texture, cinematic lighting, cool and warm light mix, steady motion, 8k, photorealistic, high detail --ar 9:16 --style raw --q 2 --v 6.0\n\n#### Option 2: Focus on Motion Blur & Fluidity (Best for Stable Diffusion XL)\n> **Prompt:** ultra-close side view selfie, chest level, girl walking forward at night, continuous motion, one hand holding phone, other hand pulling garment open, chest open, drifting background, shifting night background, motion blur, ultra-close, macro lens, f/1.2, handheld camera shake, fluid movement, continuous pull action, night outdoor, street lights streaking, 8k, unreal engine 5 render, ray tracing, volumetric light --ar 2:3 --no static, wide angle\n\n#### Option 3: Artistic & Atmospheric\n> **Prompt:** a girl walking at night, ultra-close low angle side selfie locked on chest, holding phone, pulling front of upper garment open continuously, background drifting and shifting, dreamy night atmosphere, continuous ultra-close shot, fabric unfolding, skin and fabric interlocking, light refraction, cinematic side profile, handheld perspective, steady walk, moody, ethereal, 8k --ar 16:9 --v 6.0\n\n### Key Visual Elements Breakdown\n*   **Perspective:** Ultra-close (macro) and low-angle to capture the chest and neck details.\n*   **Action:** \"Locked tightly\" implies the phone is the camera; the \"other hand\" is in constant motion pulling the clothes apart.\n*   **Background:** \"Drifting and shifting\" suggests a combination of motion blur and light streaks to convey forward movement.\n*   **Lighting:** Nighttime contrast between the dark interior of the garment and the light sources reflecting off the skin and fabric."}},{"id":1004,"type":"SpectrumMOSSImageManual","pos":[3380,3440],"size":[330,350],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":4692},{"localized_name":"warmup_steps","name":"warmup_steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"warmup_steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"tail_actual_steps","name":"tail_actual_steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tail_actual_steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"window_size","name":"window_size","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"window_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"flex_window","name":"flex_window","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"flex_window"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_consecutive_forecasts","name":"max_consecutive_forecasts","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_consecutive_forecasts"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"history_points","name":"history_points","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"history_points"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"